<h1 align="center">Templars Guild Info</h1>

<blockquote>
    <p><br>
    </p>
    <hr>
    <p><br>
    </p>
    <p>Templar info sent by Nightwatch, Summer 1999.
    <p>&nbsp;</p>
     <pre>You can find the guild near Warrior Monks guild. Just follow the road 
to Lands of King Arthur. Then follow the waterline to the northeast. Go between 
the mountain and the river and you�ll find the French Castle area. From there 
the guild is 2se and 18e.</pre>
    <pre>Some info: You will need a lightsource of somekind, because the guild is
inside the mountain. 



TEMPLAR Guild Map:


First Floor:                Second Floor:
          O<-out                
          |
