     train->O





TEMPLAR Guild Info:
Name: The Templars of Faerwon
Command: templar
Creator: Dragoness
Maximum level: 30

Description:
Templars of Faerwon are an organization of knights devoted to Good. They
wander around the world in teams of two and slay evil where it spawns. Their
order has a tradition, that no templar should ever fight alone. The templars
guide each other in the path of Goodness and guard their brother in arms that
he should not get lost. Often the younger templar acts as the squire of the
older templar.Faerwon frowns upon selfish deeds.

Joining requirements:
 Alignment must be good
 Background must be good_religious
Abilities gained when joining:
 Strength from your faith
 
 May train skill Attack to 12%
 May train skill Baptize to 12%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 16%
 May train skill Combat sense to 8%
 May train skill Consider to 12%
 May train skill Controlled panic to 16%
 May train skill Discipline to 8%
 May train skill Endurance to 0%
 May train skill First aid to 12%
 May train skill Hiking to 0%
 May train skill Parry to 8%
 May train skill Rescue to 16%
 May train skill Stunned maneuvers to 16%
 May train skill Swim to 16%
 May train skill Tempt to 16%

